{title: Zindagi}
{artist: Papon Bala Sachin Jigar}
{key: F}

{c: Verse 1}
[F]Dil ki class ki,        [C]Ghanti jo baji
Ayi [A#]yaadein,        Woh sari daud [F]ke
[F]Kisse fir mile,        Haan [C]rakh lu me unhe
Kuch [A#]panne,        Kitabon ke [F]modke
[A#]Phir se woh gali,        Hai [C]tu le chali
To [A#]theharoo,        Me thoda sa [C]yahi
[F]Hoon ruka haa haa [A#]zindagi,        [C]Tu badha haa haaa [F]zindagi
[F]Hoon galat to bata [A#]zindagi,        [C]Dede sach ka pata [A#]zindagi
[F]Ho pyare the, bharam bhi,        [F]Hum thode besharam bhi
Na [A#]koi thi shararat [F]aakhiri,        [F]Bachpane me jo sataye
[F]The samne par bhulaye,        Un [A#]yaaro se jebe fir [F]bhari
[A#]Hoke rubaroo,        Ab [C]aankhon me bharu
Woh [A#]lamhein,        Jo jiye the [C]kabhi
Ab [F]bhale tu sata [A#]zindagi,        Maaf [C]teri khata [F]zindagi
[F]Le me fir se chala [A#]zindagi,        Kyu [C]ruka tha bhala [F]zindagi
